# TI C2000 Embedded Systems Projects

This repository contains my embedded systems programs developed using the **TI TMS320F280049C (C2000) LaunchPad** and **Code Composer Studio (CCS)**.

## Topics Covered

### GPIO

* LED Blink
* 2-Bit Counter
* Push Button Interface

### ADC

* ADC Polling
* ADC Interrupt

### ePWM

* PWM Generation

### CPU Timer

* Timer-Based LED Control

### GPIO Debounce

* Push Button Debouncing

### SCI / UART

* SCI Transmission
* SCI FIFO Reception

### I2C

* DS3231 Real Time Clock Interface

### Modbus

* Modbus RTU Communication

### FreeRTOS

* LED Multitasking

## Hardware Used

* TI TMS320F280049C LaunchPad
* DS3231 RTC Module
* Push Buttons
* LEDs
* Serial Terminal

## Software Used

* Code Composer Studio (CCS)
* C2000Ware
* SysConfig
* FreeRTOS

